OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with murdering woman
OL,4,Ain Darlington
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with murdering a
OL,7,Fwoman who was found dead by police.
OL,9,FAndrew Bell, 44, of Darlington, is
OL,10,Faccused of killing Leanne Park, 44, in
OL,11,Fthe town on Wednesday.
OL,13,FDurham Police said she was pronounced
OL,14,Fdead at an address in Parkgate at about
OL,15,F21:15 BST. Her family said she was the
OL,16,F"best mam, nana, daughter and friend we
OL,17,Fcould wish for".
OL,19,FBell is due to appear at Newton
OL,20,FAycliffe Magistrates' Court on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
